    <string name="voice_button_desc">A double press of the headset or helmet play/pause key starts the voice assistant; a single press still plays or pauses the music (after a short wait). Works while RideDeck is on screen.</string>
    <string name="voice_wake_title">\"Hey RideDeck\" (experimental)</string>
    <string name="voice_wake_desc">While RideDeck is on screen the phone listens offline and opens the assistant when it hears \"Hey RideDeck\". The microphone stays on, which costs battery and heat; needs Android 13+ and the offline Turkish pack.</string>
